WEBVTT

00:17:57.650 --> 00:18:03.428
an expansive, abundant,
deeply satisfying kind of love

00:18:03.452 --> 00:18:08.569
for our fellow humans and everyone
in this act of creation.

00:18:10.331 --> 00:18:12.355
Science is love.

00:18:13.149 --> 00:18:14.752
Everyone we've met in this field

00:18:14.776 --> 00:18:18.825
just wants to get their work
from the bench and into people's lives.

00:18:19.548 --> 00:18:22.281
And it's our job to help them to do that.

00:18:23.381 --> 00:18:27.625
Because when we do,
we and everyone with us

00:18:27.649 --> 00:18:29.537
in this act of creation

00:18:29.561 --> 00:18:31.808
will be able to say,